&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;There was a $9.0&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;million decrease in the allowance for credit losses &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025, compared to January&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;1, 2025. The decrease was largely &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;driven&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; by customer write-offs in addition to a decrease in past due account balances.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri; font-weight: bold;"&gt;NOTE 5 - REGULATORY ASSETS AND LIABILITIES&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 11pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 5pt; page-break-inside: avoid; page-break-after: avoid; widows: 0; orphans: 0; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;The following regulatory assets and liabilities were reflected on our balance sheets &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;at&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025. For more information on our regulatory assets and liabilities, see Note 7, Regulatory Assets and Liabilities, in our 2025 Annual Report on Form 10-K.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
