&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;On our balance sheets, the amounts recognized for the right to reclaim cash collateral or the obligation to return cash collateral are not offset against the fair value amounts recognized for derivative instruments executed with the same counterparty under the same master netting arrangement. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;At&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; March&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;2026&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt; and December&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;31, 2025, we had posted cash collateral of $27.3&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;million and $12.2&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;million, respectively. These amounts were recorded on our balance sheets in other current assets. &lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; font-size: 10pt;"&gt;&lt;span style="font-family: Calibri;"&gt;&amp;#160;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
