  <ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock id="HHEBA1CD44839C108D1DAFD6DE3427BE45" contextRef="HH6F430EA68AFC29D1DD829B0DDD45FFF4">&lt;div&gt;&lt;p&gt;8.&amp;#160;Management employees at WE received an average merit increase of&amp;#160; 3.50% effective January 1, 2026&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Last negotiated wage increases part of collective bargaining agreements are as follows:&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Local 2006 USW: 4.3% effective November 1, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Local 2150 IBEW: 4.6% effective August 16, 2025.&amp;#160;&amp;#160;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Local 420 IUOE: 4.2% effective October 1, 2025.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;</ferc:DisclosureOfEstimatedAnnualEffectAndNatureOfAnyImportantWageScaleChangesTextBlock>
