              <td style="width: 50.0686%;">Reimbursement for ATC's construction costs</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0686%; text-align: right;">33,067,281</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0686%;">Other operating</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0686%; text-align: right;">181,795</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0686%;">Other investing activities, net</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0686%; text-align: right;">$ 25,461,683</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HHBCD2E34BE8907FF998C65B9AD1D8DC6A" xlink:to="HH711180B883A9851D51F620916A855BB9" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH06DB94C923DD82C1CED1C11609C20B69" xlink:label="HH06DB94C923DD82C1CED1C11609C20B69" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHF60F4FD0ACCDA404478F3A550AB52DFB" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>232 L25a</p>
        <p>This line includes the WI Jurisdiction MISO Schedule 33 Blackstart Revenues of $600,739.</p>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH06DB94C923DD82C1CED1C11609C20B69" xlink:to="HHF60F4FD0ACCDA404478F3A550AB52DFB" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH63E1380C325E1C505803809AF664B856" xlink:label="HH63E1380C325E1C505803809AF664B856" />
    <link:footnote xlink:type="resource" xlink:label="HHD7901BF2E0DA59BEBA5A2FC8824FEDF5" xlink:role="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/role/footnote" xml:lang="en">
      <div xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
        <p>278 L7a</p>
        <p>During 2014, the Company received a U.S. Treasury Section 1603 cash grant related to the construction of the Rothschild Biomass Cogeneration Facility. Our Wisconsin jurisdiction required that the grant be given back to customers within essentially one rate cycle. For FERC purposes, the appropriate accounting treatment is providing the cash grant benefit over the estimated life of the facility. On that basis, the annual amortization is $1,906,815 over 40 years through 2054.</p>
        <table style="border-collapse: collapse; width: 62.894%; height: 182px;" border="1">
          <tbody>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Beginning Balance 01/1/2026</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">$ 54,185,322</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Grant Amortization</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">(476,704)</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Ending Balance 3/31/2026</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">$ 53,708,618</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">&#160;</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Amortization Calculation:&#160;</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">&#160;</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Grant Received</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">$ 76,272,596</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Years</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">40</td>
            </tr>
            <tr>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%;">Amortization Per Year</td>
              <td style="width: 50.0717%; text-align: right;">$&#160; 1,906,815</td>
            </tr>
          </tbody>
        </table>
      </div>
    </link:footnote>
    <link:footnoteArc xlink:type="arc" xlink:arcrole="http://www.xbrl.org/2003/arcrole/fact-footnote" xlink:from="HH63E1380C325E1C505803809AF664B856" xlink:to="HHD7901BF2E0DA59BEBA5A2FC8824FEDF5" order="1" />
    <link:loc xlink:type="locator" xlink:href="#HH9B81DE0EA1833D2278DE00EA399A88D8" xlink:label="HH9B81DE0EA1833D2278DE00EA399A88D8" />
